        <h1 class="post-detail__title">2018 Tin Cup Challenge Event Day</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47465.webp" alt="2018 Tin Cup Challenge Event Day" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <div>
<p>The 11<sup>th</sup>Annual Tin Cup Challenge Event Day was a terrific success!  The Community Foundation of Teton Valley provided Teton Valley with an extraordinary event promoting philanthropy in our community while celebrating the ingenuity of our local nonprofits’ efforts to elevate life in Teton Valley. Our gratitude goes out to the many donors, volunteers, and nonprofits that make this event so successful annually.</p>
<p><img data-opt-id=1755377522   decoding="async" title="IMG_5752" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20100%%20100%%22%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="IMG_5752" width="117" height="175" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1755377522  decoding="async" title="IMG_5752" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/IMG_575cftv-events/ed-exchange/2.jpg" alt="IMG_5752" width="117" height="175" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /></noscript>   <img data-opt-id=836972795  decoding="async" title="Diaper Derby" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/1117-170(C)SwopePhoto.jpg" alt="Diaper Derby" width="233" height="175" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" />   <img data-opt-id=1233069661   decoding="async" title="Aquatics" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20100%%20100%%22%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="Aquatics" width="262" height="175" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1233069661  decoding="async" title="Aquatics" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/IMG_572cftv-events/ed-exchange/1.jpg" alt="Aquatics" width="262" height="175" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /></noscript></p>

<div>
<p>The community was pleased to return to the Driggs City Park after a three-year hiatus. Nonprofits took advantage of the additional space by offering some truly unique booth activities that captured their missions in a big way. To name a few, the Teton Valley Education Foundation used a working school bus as a gallery for their ArtReach Program, the Teton Valley Foundation brought the unique game of soap hockey to Tin Cup goers, the Teton Valley Balloon Rally partially inflated a balloon for the public to walk inside and participants of the Mountain Bike the Teton&#8217;s booth made their own smoothies with bicycle power.</p>

<div>        <img data-opt-id=1297916281  decoding="async" title="Soap Hockey" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/1117-210(C)SwopePhoto.jpg" alt="Soap Hockey" width="195" height="149" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" />   <a href="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Swope176.1117-197CSwopes-Mountain-Photography.jpg" data-large_image_width="5184" data-large_image_height="3888"><img data-opt-id=1534824358   alt="" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20100%%20100%%22%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="213" height="159" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1534824358  alt="" decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Swope176.1117-197CSwopes-Mountain-Photography-700x52tin-cup/2024-tin-cup-event/5.jpg" alt="" width="213" height="159" /></noscript></a>   <a href="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Vanderhorst13.TinCup2018-14cftv-events/ed-exchange/2.jpg" data-large_image_width="5760" data-large_image_height="3840"><img data-opt-id=1883011867   alt="" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20700%20467%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="236" height="158" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1883011867  alt="" decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:700/h:467/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Vanderhorst13.TinCup2018-142.jpg" alt="" width="236" height="158" /></noscript></a>
<div>
<p>Six hundred racers enjoyed the all-new course that utilized a pathway, brought to us by Teton Valley Trails and Pathways, for more than half the route. The latter half of the route wound its way back to the City Park through neighborhoods streets. Folks came out of their houses to cheer runners as they passed and a light rain shower cooled racers as they crossed the finish line.</p>

<div>        <img data-opt-id=1680011433   decoding="async" title="Racers Off!" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20100%%20100%%22%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="Racers Off!" width="233" height="144" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1680011433  decoding="async" title="Racers Off!" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/IMG_571tin-cup/2024-tin-cup-event/6.jpg" alt="Racers Off!" width="233" height="144" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /></noscript>  <img data-opt-id=1870161237  decoding="async" title="Racer on Course" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/1117-068(C)SwopePhoto.jpg" alt="Racer on Course" width="205" height="152" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" />  <a href="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Vanderhorst25.TinCup2018-5tin-cup/2024-tin-cup-event/6.jpg" data-large_image_width="5760" data-large_image_height="3840"><img data-opt-id=696097983   alt="" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20700%20467%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="230" height="153" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=696097983  alt="" decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:700/h:467/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Vanderhorst25.TinCup2018-56.jpg" alt="" width="230" height="153" /></noscript></a>
<div>
<p>The Awards Ceremony led with the Dawn Banks Nonprofit Leadership Award. This award recognizes a local nonprofit leader who exemplifies excellence in nonprofit practices and comes with a $1,000 grant. This year’s recipient was Amy Verbeten, of Friends of the Teton River, for her dedication, reputation, positive attitude and collaboration with a diverse set of stakeholders, agencies and other nonprofits. The Tin Cup Spirit Award and $1,000 grant for nonprofit presence on the race course went to Teton Arts, with an honorable mention to Teton Valley Aquatics. Race awards followed with awards purchased from local businesses.</p>

<div>        <img data-opt-id=783137735   decoding="async" title="Amy Verbeten" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20100%%20100%%22%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22100%%22%20height%3D%22100%%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="Amy Verbeten" width="116" height="170" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=783137735  decoding="async" title="Amy Verbeten" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/180721_0888.jpg" alt="Amy Verbeten" width="116" height="170" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" /></noscript>  <img data-opt-id=1215671687  decoding="async" title="Teton Arts" src="https://8e7cc30df0-custmedia.vresp.com/7c499e493e/1117-154(C)SwopePhoto%20tin-cup/2024-tin-cup-event/3.jpg" alt="Teton Arts" width="262" height="170" align="none" border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" />  <a href="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Borrenpohl07.180721_090tin-cup/2024-tin-cup-event/6.jpg" data-large_image_width="5184" data-large_image_height="3456"><img data-opt-id=1890417751   alt="" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20700%20467%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="255" height="251" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1890417751  alt="" decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:700/h:467/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Borrenpohl07.180721_0906-700x467.jpg" alt="" width="255" height="251" /></noscript></a>
<div>
<div>
<p>Our efforts to make the Tin Cup Event Day a greener, more sustainable celebration were met with praise from the community. This year, our breakfast was all new, comprised of primarily locally sourced, pre-packaged dry goods and fresh fruit. Teton Valley Community Recycling provided a Hydration Station for water bottle refills and lead the Green Team on Event Day, while Full Circle Education was able to utilize the plates, napkins and fruit waste in a Composting Workshop that followed Tin Cup.</p>

<div>
<p>       <img data-opt-id=307656850   alt="" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20700%20467%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="213" height="140" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=307656850  alt="" decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:700/h:467/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Tremblay022.IMG_5733-700x467.jpg" alt="" width="213" height="140" /></noscript>  <a href="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Tremblay006.IMG_570cftv-events/ed-exchange/1.jpg" data-large_image_width="5472" data-large_image_height="3648"><img data-opt-id=1420204868   alt="" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20700%20467%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="212" height="141" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1420204868  alt="" decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:700/h:467/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Tremblay006.IMG_5701-700x467.jpg" alt="" width="212" height="141" /></noscript>  </a><a href="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:auto/h:auto/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Swope200.1117-232CSwopes-Mountain-Photography.jpg" data-large_image_width="5568" data-large_image_height="3712"><img data-opt-id=703611872   alt="" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20700%20467%22%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22700%22%20height%3D%22467%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="213" height="144" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=703611872  alt="" decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:700/h:467/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/Swope200.1117-232CSwopes-Mountain-Photography-700x467.jpg" alt="" width="213" height="144" /></noscript></a></p>
<p>Despite the occasional passing rain shower, the generosity of our community brought light to hundreds of faces. Thank you to the many champions of Teton Valley&#8217;s hard-working nonprofits. Tin Cup Event Day illustrates generosity in action – across all fronts. We greatly appreciate your support.</p>
